                        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Amazon.fr : PS5 Slim</strong>

                        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Alerte si < 430 € (Scan auto 30s)</div>

                    </div>

                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-mono">Active</span>

                </div>

                <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#08080a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between">

                    <div>

                        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Cdiscount : MacBook Air M2</strong>

                        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Alerte si < 980 € (Stock France)</div>

